  "description": "Celebrating failure. \n\nFeeling like a failure after giving up her lifelong dream, Kkang-Jang travels to Iceland, a country where failure is embraced — and also one of the most expensive places in the world. Can she make her journey work on a shoestring budget? Follow along as she travels with the help of a guardian spirit! \n\n(Source: Manta)",
